{"id": "places/training-grounds", "type": "places", "slug": "training-grounds", "title": "Training Grounds", "summary": "A practice zone in the south of the city: PvP ring, moving targets, a guardian test, and a free build test (your real stats come back when you leave); nothing done there counts on the records.", "rarity": null, "is_overview": false, "image": "/games/overrank/places/training-grounds-512.webp", "infobox": [{"key": "Features", "value": "a PvP ring, a guardian test", "html": "<dd>a PvP ring, a guardian test</dd>"}], "sections": [{"id": "overview", "heading": "Overview", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "text": "A practice zone in the south of the city: PvP ring, moving targets, a guardian test, and a free build test (your real stats come back when you leave); nothing done there counts on the records. The per-class training rifts (Awakening Dojo, Proving Forge, Shade Maze, Vigil Sanctum, Arcane Archive, Ossuary) are switched off in this version.", "html": "<p>A practice zone in the south of the city: PvP ring, moving targets, a guardian test, and a free build test (your real stats come back when you leave); nothing done there counts on the records. The per-class training rifts (Awakening Dojo, Proving Forge, Shade Maze, Vigil Sanctum, Arcane Archive, Ossuary) are switched off in this version.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "text": "", "html": "<p><img alt=\"Training grounds in the game\" src=\"/games/overrank/places/training-grounds.webp\"/></p>"}]}, {"id": "what-you-find-here", "heading": "What you find here", "blocks": [{"type": "ul", "text": "A PvP ring A guardian test", "html": "<ul> <li>A PvP ring</li> <li>A guardian test</li> </ul>"}]}], "media": [], "related": [{"text": "Rune Temple", "href": "/en/w/overrank/places/rune-temple", "img": "/games/overrank/places/rune-temple-512.webp"}, {"text": "The System's trial", "href": "/en/w/overrank/places/systems-trial", "img": "/games/overrank/rifts/undiscovered-512.webp"}, {"text": "The City", "href": "/en/w/overrank/place